---
// Chapter 01: Arrival Story
---

<section class="section arrival-section" id="story">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="arrival-grid">
      <!-- Left Column: Story Copy -->
      <div class="arrival-copy reveal-left">
        <div class="story-marker">Chapter 01 · Arrival</div>
        <div class="eyebrow">The city comes first</div>
        <h2>Varanasi can be intense. Your stay shouldn’t be.</h2>
        
        <p class="lead">
          A visitor spends the day absorbing crowds, temples, ghats, sounds, rituals and narrow lanes. Thakur Ji becomes the place where that energy softens — a comfortable, dependable reset between moments in the sacred city.
        </p>

        <blockquote class="story-quote">
          “See Kashi fully. Then come back somewhere that lets you slow down.”
        </blockquote>

        <div class="arrival-chips">
          <span class="chip">Arrive without fuss</span>
          <span class="chip">Cool down & reset</span>
          <span class="chip">Rest with family</span>
          <span class="chip">Plan the next morning</span>
          <span class="chip">Step back into Kashi</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Reception Photo with inner gold border & floating seal -->
      <div class="arrival-photo-wrap reveal">
        <div class="photo-frame">
          <picture>
            <source srcset="/images/reception.webp" type="image/webp" />
            <img 
              id="storyParallax" 
              src="/images/reception.jpg" 
              alt="Reception and welcoming entry of Thakur Ji Guest House Varanasi" 
              loading="lazy" 
              width="1418" 
              height="944"
            />
          </picture>
          <div class="photo-gradient"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="story-seal" aria-hidden="true">
          <span>
            YOUR PAUSE<br />
            BETWEEN MOMENTS<br />
            IN KASHI
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.arrival-section {
  background: transparent;
  padding-top: 120px;
  padding-bottom: 120px;
}

.arrival-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
  gap: 6vw;
  align-items: center;
}

.arrival-copy h2 {
  margin: 12px 0 20px;
  font: 600 clamp(44px, 4.8vw, 76px) / 0.94 var(--font-serif);
  letter-spacing: -1.2px;
  color: #5d1118;
}

.arrival-copy .lead {
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.85;
  color: var(--soft);
}

.story-quote {
  margin: 32px 0 28px;
  padding-left: 24px;
  border-left: 2px solid #bf914b;
  font: 500 28px / 1.3 var(--font-serif);
  color: #5d1118;
  font-style: italic;
}

.arrival-chips {
  display: flex;
  gap: 10px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  margin-top: 24px;
}

.chip {
  padding: 10px 16px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(115, 77, 51, 0.14);
  background: #fffaf2;
  border-radius: 999px;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #704936;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02);
  transition: transform 0.25s, border-color 0.25s;
}

.chip:hover {
  transform: translateY(-2px);
  border-color: #b9893f;
}

/* Right Photo Frame */
.arrival-photo-wrap {
  position: relative;
}

.photo-frame {
  height: 600px;
  position: relative;
  border-radius: 34px;
  overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: 0 35px 90px rgba(47, 23, 16, 0.2);
  background: #25090c;
}

.photo-frame img {
  position: absolute;
  inset: -6% 0 0 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 112%;
  object-fit: cover;
  will-change: transform;
  transition: transform 0.4s ease-out;
}

.photo-frame::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 16px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(241, 210, 145, 0.4);
  border-radius: 24px;
  z-index: 2;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.photo-gradient {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 65%, rgba(20, 5, 6, 0.5) 100%);
  z-index: 1;
}

.story-seal {
  position: absolute;
  left: -48px;
  bottom: 48px;
  width: 140px;
  height: 140px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #f7ede0;
  color: #6a1118;
  border: 1px solid rgba(185, 137, 63, 0.35);
  box-shadow: 0 20px 46px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  text-align: center;
  font: 700 12px / 1.3 var(--font-serif);
  letter-spacing: 1.2px;
  transform: rotate(-8deg);
  z-index: 4;
  padding: 16px;
  transition: transform 0.4s ease;
}

.story-seal:hover {
  transform: rotate(0deg) scale(1.05);
}

@media (max-width: 1100px) {
  .arrival-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 48px;
  }
  .photo-frame {
    height: 480px;
  }
}

@media (max-width: 680px) {
  .arrival-section {
    padding-top: 80px;
    padding-bottom: 80px;
  }
  .story-quote {
    font-size: 23px;
    padding-left: 18px;
  }
  .photo-frame {
    height: 380px;
    border-radius: 24px;
  }
  .story-seal {
    left: 14px;
    bottom: 14px;
    width: 115px;
    height: 115px;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.8px;
  }
}
</style>
